    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "implementation flexibility... okay, that's vague. but look, I saw a leaked memo from their finance ministry earlier that says they're planning to double the tariffs on tech imports by next year. that's a huge shift from what they told us this morning. did your internal monitoring pick that up? I need to know if they're playing us.",
